<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>(Tourist rates will differ from those quoted)</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3640/45  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.6914/19  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.9030/35  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4555/65  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     34.88/93   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.7072/82  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1691.1/2.1 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     123.40/50  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.7410/85  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.8235/55  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.4611/31  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>		     1.4342/52  Singapore Dollars</p>
<p>		     0.7961/66  Australian Dollars</p>
<p>		     7.7443/53  Hong Kong Dollars</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.5945/55</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$351.80/352.30</p>
</text>
